# AI coding assistants. BMAD reinstalls and updates regenerate all of these,
# so they are reproducible on any machine and must never be committed.
#
# READ THIS BEFORE ADDING A PATH HERE. Gitignore is only consulted for
# UNTRACKED files. If a path is already committed the rule does nothing until
# you run `git rm -r --cached <path>`, which drops it from the index and leaves
# it on disk. That is exactly why `.claude` sat in this file from 2026-08-12
# with no effect: its 876 files had been committed on 2026-08-04.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
.agents/
.agent/
.claude/
.cursor/
.codex/
.antigravity/
.gemini/
